  "prefLabel": "Geo 502.01 Procedure for Surrendering a License",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Geo 502.01 Procedure for Surrendering a License. Any person holding a license may voluntarily surrender that license by returning it to the board accompanied by a signed letter stating that he or she intends to surrender his or her license.\n\nSource. #7526, eff 7-1-01; ss #9439, eff 3-25-09; ss by #12152, eff 3-24-17",
